      "start": 1700,
      "details": "\r\n<p>Lipara is listed as \"Lipari\" in the <em>BTCGI</em>. The association between the two places can be also found in Manni 1981 and the <em>Barrington Atlas</em>. The modern municipality of Lipari includes, besides the homonymous one, the other five Eolian Islands: Vulcano, Panarea, Stromboli, Filicudi, and Alicudi.</p>\r\n",
